{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-switch-phone-shop-1-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-6","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-1","refs":["F-phone-310","F-phone-313","F-phone-314","F-phone-316","F-phone-325","F-phone-335","F-phone-308"],"severity":"S3","title":"A member who joins from the invite link sees no plan, no plan reminders and no diet plan until they scan the check-in poster at the gym","what":"Joining from the gym's invite link asks only for a name. My membership, the plan-ending card, pause or renew, the 9:30 plan reminders and the trainer's diet plan all find the member by the mobile number saved at a QR check-in, so until then the member only reads 'Check in once to link your membership'. A gym that checks members in at the desk, or has not put up the poster, never gets its members linked. At Crispy Curves 1 of 2 app members has the number saved.","expected":"The member can give their mobile number when they join (or from the 'Check in once' card at home), so the plan shows the same day.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/InviteScreen.tsx:177-193","apps/mobile/src/shop/membership.ts:121-123","supabase/migrations/0055_pass_members.sql:78-79","supabase/migrations/0015_qr_checkin.sql:11-16","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymBody.ts:253-254","machine:field-fill.csv#check-in phone"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"plan-link-waits-for-qr-checkin","who":"members who joined by invite link","how_often":"every invite join until a QR check-in","fix_line":"Ask for the mobile number on the join screen and on the 'Check in once' card","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
